# Database Schema & Context (Supabase)

Table Name: `jobs` (Row Level Security is currently DISABLED for testing)

## Table Columns & Data Types
- `id`: `uuid` (Primary Key, auto-generated)
- `created_at`: `timestamptz` (auto-generated)
- `title`: `text` (required)
- `company_name`: `text` (required)
- `pay_range`: `text` (optional)
- `employment_types`: `text[]` (Array of strings for multi-select tags)
- `description`: `text` (required)
- `apply_method`: `text` (required — `'url'` or `'email'`)
- `apply_value`: `text` (required — website link or email address)
- `employer_email`: `text` (required)
- `edit_token`: `uuid` (auto-generated)
- `status`: `text` (default `'pending'` — allowed values: `'pending'`, `'live'`, `'expired'`)

## Rules for AI Agent
- Use this exact table name (`jobs`) and column names for all Supabase queries.
- Do not invent extra columns or change column types.
- Assume public `SELECT`, `INSERT`, `UPDATE`, and `DELETE` access on this table during the initial build phase.